MODULE 3: WHAT IS ROBUSTNESS?
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION:

- AI is increasingly used to help make crucial decisions, so it is vital that AI is secure and
    robust. When AI is robust, it can more effectively handle exceptional conditions, like
    abnormalities in input or malicious attacks, without causing unintentional harm.


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

    - After completing this module, you should be able to:
        -> Describe adversarial robustness within AI
        -> Explain how an adversary can influence an AI system
        -> Categorize adversarial attacks